# Claude Code 2.1.326, trusted folder, mock Messages API: a turn stopped
# with Ctrl+C as 0x03 (YIEN's byte), then Ctrl+C twice more to exit. The
# capture runs with YIEN's hook settings (--settings, the yien-hook events);
# the recording went through a logging stand-in for yien-hook, so the hook
# calls are visible in the report, not in this file.
# Preconditions: the work folder already trusted (answer the folder trust
# screen once; Claude writes the projects entry itself) and the "custom API
# key" question answered Yes once (Claude persists it in ~/.claude.json).
wait-for 60000 effort
text slow please
key enter
wait-for 30000 interrupt
key ctrl-c
wait 3000
key ctrl-c
key ctrl-c
wait-exit 10000
